{!<tr><td><div class="box" style='background-color:#dc0100; outline: 2px; outline-style: solid;'> </div> !} **[+ spd_name +]:** {!</td><td>!} **[+ spd_mer +]%** {!</td><td>!} **[+ mer_change_spd +]** {!</td></tr>!}

[? if sapd_formed : {!<tr><td><div class="box" style='background-color:#920002'> </div> !}KPM: {!</td><td>!} [+ sapd_mer +]% {!</td><td>!} [+ mer_change_sapd +] {!</td></tr>!} ?]

[? if asum_formed : {!<tr><td><div class="box" style='background-color:#dd5b00'> </div> !}ASUM: {!</td><td>!} [+ asum_mer +]% {!</td><td>!} [+ mer_change_asum +] {!</td></tr>!} ?]

[? if spm_formed : {!<tr><td><div class="box" style='background-color:#dc0200'> </div> !}SPM: {!</td><td>!} [+ spm_mer +]% {!</td><td>!} [+ mer_change_spm +] {!</td></tr>!} ?]

{!<tr><td><div class="box" style='background-color:#ddd500'> </div> !} [+ ddp_name +]: {!</td><td>!} [+ ddp_mer +]% {!</td><td>!} [+ mer_change_ddp +] {!</td></tr>!}

{!<tr><td><div class="box" style='background-color:#48b94a'> </div> !} GDSU: {!</td><td>!} [+ z_mer +]% {!</td><td>!} [+ mer_change_z +] {!</td></tr>!}

[? if blpm_formed : {!<tr><td><div class="box" style='background-color:#00e8ff'> </div> !}BLPM: {!</td><td>!} [+ blpm_mer +]% {!</td><td>!} [+ mer_change_blpm +] {!</td></tr>!} ?]

{!<tr><td><div class="box" style='background-color:#4b9ee0'> </div> !} PPU+: {!</td><td>!} [+ ppu_mer +]% {!</td><td>!} [+ mer_change_ppu +] {!</td></tr>!}

{!<tr><td><div class="box" style='background-color:#caa58b'> </div> !} [+ dvp_name +]: {!</td><td>!} [+ dvp_mer +]% {!</td><td>!} [+ mer_change_dvp +] {!</td></tr>!}
 
{!<tr><td><div class="box" style='background-color:#dddddd'> </div> !} Others: {!</td><td>!} [+ other_mer +] % {!</td><td>!} [+ mer_change_other +] {!</td></tr>!}

[? if gnvp_formed : {!<tr><td><div class="box" style='background-color:#774ae2'> </div> !}GNVP: {!</td><td>!} [+ gnvp_mer +]% {!</td><td>!} [+ mer_change_gnvp +] {!</td></tr>!} ?]

{!<tr><td><div class="box" style='background-color:#1125e0'> </div> !} MNVP: {!</td><td>!} [+ dnvp_mer +]% {!</td><td>!} [+ mer_change_dnvp +] {!</td></tr>!}

{!<tr><td><div class="box" style='background-color:#706a65'> </div> !} NSDAP: {!</td><td>!} [+ nsdap_mer +]% {!</td><td>!} [+ mer_change_nsdap +] {!</td></tr>!}
{!</table>!}

**Potential coalitions:**

Zeltbrin Coalition (<span style="color: #dc0200;">**[+ spd_name +]**</span> + <span style="color: #48b94a;">GDSU</span> + <span style="color: #ddd500;">FVP</span>): [+ weimar_coalition_mer +]%

[? if weimar_coalition < 50 and liberal_reconciliation >= 10: Wide - Zeltbrin Coalition (<span style="color: #dc0200;">**[+ spd_name +]**</span> + <span style="color: #48b94a;">GDSU</span> + <span style="color: #ddd500;">FVP</span> + <span style="color: #4a9fde;">PPU</span>[? if blpm_formed = 1 : + <span style="color: #00e8ff;">BLPM</span> ?]): [+ zeltbrin_plus_coalition_mer +]% ?]

[? if liberal_reconciliation >= 18: Grand Coalition (<span style="color: #dc0200;">**[+ spd_name +]**</span> + <span style="color: #48b94a;">GDSU</span> + <span style="color: #ddd500;">FVP</span> + <span style="color: #4a9fde;">PPU</span> + <span style="color: #caa58b;">LDP</span>[? if blpm_formed = 1 : + <span style="color: #00e8ff;">BLPM</span> ?] ): [+ grand_coalition_mer +]% ?]

Liberal Coalition (<span style="color: #caa58b;">LDP</span> + <span style="color: #48b94a;">GDSU</span> + <span style="color: #ddd500;">FVP</span> + <span style="color: #4a9fde;">PPU</span>): [+ liberal_coalition_mer +]%

[? if liberal_coalition < 50 : Wide - Liberal Coalition (<span style="color: #caa58b;">LDP</span> + <span style="color: #48b94a;">GDSU</span> + <span style="color: #ddd500;">FVP</span> + <span style="color: #4a9fde;">PPU</span> + others): [+ wide_liberal_coalition_mer +]% ?]

Center-Right Coalition (<span style="color: #48b94a;">GDSU</span> + <span style="color: #caa58b;">LDP</span> + <span style="color: #4a9fde;">PPU</span> + others + <span style="color: #3F7BC1;">MNVP</span> [? if gnvp_formed = 1 : + <span style="color: #774ae2;">GNVP</span>  ?][? if blpm_formed = 1 : + <span style="color: #00e8ff;">BLPM</span>  ?]): [+ center_right_coalition_mer +]%

Right-wing Coalition (<span style="color: #caa58b;">LDP</span> + others + <span style="color: #3F7BC1;">MNVP</span> [? if gnvp_formed = 1 : + <span style="color: #774ae2;">GNVP</span> ?]): [+ right_coalition_mer +]%

[? if anti_democratic_coalition >= 50 : Together, the anti-democratic KPD, DNVP, and NSDAP have a majority in the Reichstag. A stable governing majority will be almost impossible. ?]

There are some potential coalition arrangements.

-@spd: We achived a <span style="color: #dc0200;">**[+ spd_name +]**</span> majority!
-@left: We achived a <span style="color: #d61818;">Socialist</span> majority of all the left wing patries!
-@prog_fro: We can atempth to form a <span style="color: #d61818;">Progr</span><span style="color: #ddd500;">esive</span> front with the <span style="color: #ddd500;">FVP</span> and other leftists parties.
-@popu: We can try to form the Popular Front bettwen the <span style="color: #48b94a;">GDSU</span>,<span style="color: #ddd500;">FVP</span> and other leftists parties.
-@prog: We can atempth to form a <span style="color: #d61818;">Progr</span><span style="color: #ddd500;">esive</span> Coalition with the <span style="color: #ddd500;">FVP</span>.
-@zelt: Zeltbrin coalition could be possible. 
-@zelt_whide: We can try a wide Zeltbrin coalition. 
-@grand: Maybe the reactionary Grand coalition? 
-@lib: The Liberal coalition is formed. 
-@lib_whide: The liberals can form a wide coalition. 
-@cent_right: Center right coalition could form. 
-@right: A reactionary Right wing coalition could form.
-@far_right: This is the end....
-@coalition: Maybe we can try some other

@spd
view-if: spd_mer >= 50
on-arrival: spd_mer_gov = 1; merkia_gov = 1; local_spd = 1; 

@left
subtitle: [+ spd_name +][? if sapd_formed : + <span style="color: #940000;">KPM</span> ?][? if asum_formed: + <span style="color: #9B0000;">ASUM</span> ?][? if spm_formed : + <span style="color: #ff1919;">SPM</span> ?]([+ left_coalition_mer +]%)
view-if: left_coalition_mer >= 45 and (sapd_formed > 0 or spm_formed > 0)
choose-if: left_coalition_mer >= 50 and (kpm_coa + spm_coa) >= 130
unavailable-subtitle: [? if (kpm_coa + spm_coa) < 130: We do not have good enough relations with the other socialist parties. ?]
on-arrival: spd_mer_gov = 1; merkia_gov = 1; local_spd = 1; asum_mer_gov = 1; spm_mer_gov = 1; sapd_mer_gov = 1;

@prog_fro
subtitle: [+ spd_name +][? if sapd_formed : + <span style="color: #940000;">KPM</span> ?][? if asum_formed: + <span style="color: #9B0000;">ASUM</span> ?][? if spm_formed : + <span style="color: #ff1919;">SPM</span> ?] + <span style="color: #ddd500;">FVP</span> ([+ progressive_front_mer +]%)
view-if: progressive_front_mer >= 45 and sapd_formed > 0
choose-if: progressive_front_mer >= 50 and (kpm_coa + spm_coa) >= 140 and ddp_coa >= 75
unavailable-subtitle: [? if (kpm_coa + spm_coa) < 140: We do not have good enough relations with the other socialist parties. ?][? if ddp_coa < 75: We do not have good enough relations with the <span style="color: #ddd500;">FVP</span>. ?]
on-arrival: spd_mer_gov = 1; merkia_gov = 1; local_spd = 1; asum_mer_gov = 1; spm_mer_gov = 1; sapd_mer_gov = 1; ddp_mer_gov = 1;

@popu
subtitle: [+ spd_name +][? if sapd_formed : + <span style="color: #940000;">KPM</span> ?][? if asum_formed: + <span style="color: #9B0000;">ASUM</span> ?][? if spm_formed : + <span style="color: #ff1919;">SPM</span> ?] + <span style="color: #ddd500;">FVP</span> + <span style="color: #48ba48;">GDSU</span> ([+ popular_front_coalition_mer +]%)
view-if: popular_front_coalition_mer >= 45 and sapd_formed > 0
choose-if: popular_front_coalition_mer >= 50 and (kpm_coa + spm_coa) >= 150 and ddp_coa >= 80 and gdsu_coa >= 80 and liberal_reconciliation >= 18
unavailable-subtitle: [? if (kpm_coa + spm_coa) < 150: We do not have good enough relations with the other socialist parties. ?][? if gdsu_coa < 75: We do not have good enough relations with the <span style="color: #48ba48;">GDSU</span>. ?][? if fvp_coa < 75: We do not have good enough relations with the <span style="color: #ddd500;">FVP</span>. ?][? if liberal_reconciliation < 18: The Liberal Parties do not trust us enough to enter into a goverment with communists. ?]
on-arrival: spd_mer_gov = 1; merkia_gov = 1; local_spd = 1; asum_mer_gov = 1; spm_mer_gov = 1; sapd_mer_gov = 1; ddp_mer_gov = 1; z_mer_gov = 1;

@prog
subtitle: [+ spd_name +][? if spm_formed : + <span style="color: #ff1919;">SPM</span> ?] + <span style="color: #ddd500;">FVP</span> ([+ progressive_coalition_mer +]%)
view-if: progressive_coalition_mer >= 45
choose-if: progressive_coalition_mer >= 50 and ddp_coa >= 70 and liberal_reconciliation >= 10
unavailable-subtitle: We do not have good enough relations with the <span style="color: #ddd500;">FVP</span> and they do not trust us enough.
on-arrival: spd_mer_gov = 1; merkia_gov = 1; local_spd = 1; spm_mer_gov = 1; ddp_mer_gov = 1;

@zelt
view-if: weimar_coalition_mer >= 45 and liberal_reconciliation >= 6
subtitle: [+ spd_name +][? if spm_formed : + <span style="color: #ff1919;">SPM</span> ?] + <span style="color: #ddd500;">FVP</span> + <span style="color: #48ba48;">GDSU</span> ([+ weimar_coalition_mer +]%)
choose-if: weimar_coalition_mer >= 50 and ddp_coa >= 65 and gdsu_coa >= 65 and liberal_reconciliation >= 10
unavailable-subtitle: [? if gdsu_coa < 75: We do not have good enough relations with the <span style="color: #48ba48;">GDSU</span>. ?][? if fvp_coa < 75: We do not have good enough relations with the <span style="color: #ddd500;">FVP</span>. ?][? if liberal_reconciliation < 10: The Liberal Parties do not trust us enough to enter into a goverment with us. ?]
on-arrival: spd_mer_gov = 1; merkia_gov = 1; local_spd = 1; spm_mer_gov = 1; ddp_mer_gov = 1; z_mer_gov = 1;

@zelt_whide
view-if: zeltbrin_plus_coalition_mer >= 50 and weimar_coalition_mer <= 50 and liberal_reconciliation >= 8
subtitle: [+ spd_name +][? if spm_formed : + <span style="color: #ff1919;">SPM</span> ?] + <span style="color: #ddd500;">FVP</span> + <span style="color: #48ba48;">GDSU</span> + <span style="color: #4b9fde;">PPU</span>[? if blpm_formed : + <span style="color: #00e8ff;">BLPM</span> ?]([+ weimar_coalition_mer +]%)
choose-if: zeltbrin_plus_coalition_mer >= 50 and ddp_coa >= 70 and gdsu_coa >= 70 and liberal_reconciliation >= 12 and ppu_coa >= 65
unavailable-subtitle: [? if gdsu_coa < 75: We do not have good enough relations with the <span style="color: #48ba48;">GDSU</span>. ?][? if fvp_coa < 75: We do not have good enough relations with the <span style="color: #ddd500;">FVP</span>. ?][? if liberal_reconciliation < 12: The Liberal Parties do not trust us enough to enter into a goverment with us. ?]
on-arrival: spd_mer_gov = 1; merkia_gov = 1; local_spd = 1; spm_mer_gov = 1; ddp_mer_gov = 1; z_mer_gov = 1; ppu_mer_gov = 1;

@grand
view-if: grand_coalition_mer >= 50 and zeltbrin_plus_coalition_mer <= 50  and liberal_reconciliation >= 16 and center_right_coalition_mer <= 50
subtitle: [+ spd_name +][? if spm_formed : + <span style="color: #ff1919;">SPM</span> ?] + <span style="color: #ddd500;">FVP</span> + <span style="color: #48ba48;">GDSU</span> + <span style="color: #4b9fde;">PPU</span>[? if blpm_formed : + <span style="color: #00e8ff;">BLPM</span> ?] + <span style="color: #fbffd5;">[+ dvp_name +]</span> + Other([+ grand_coalition_mer +]%)
choose-if: grand_coalition_mer >= 50 and liberal_reconciliation >= 18 and (fvp_coa + gdsu_coa) >= 140 and ldp_coa >= 65 and ppu_coa >= 65 and ppu_coa >= 65 and other_coa >= 65
on-arrival: spd_mer_gov = 1; merkia_gov = 1; local_spd = 1; spm_mer_gov = 1; ddp_mer_gov = 1; z_mer_gov = 1; ppu_mer_gov = 1; other_mer_gov = 1; dvp_mer_gov = 1;
unavailable-subtitle: [? if (fvp_coa + gdsu_coa) <= 140: We do not have good enough relations with the left Liberals. ?][? if ldp_coa < 75: The LDP, is unwilling to compromise at all. ?][? if liberal_reconciliation < 18: The Liberal Parties do not trust us enough to enter into a goverment with us. ?]

@lib
view-if: liberal_coalition_mer >= 45
subtitle: <span style="color: #ddd500;">FVP</span> + <span style="color: #48ba48;">GDSU</span> + <span style="color: #4b9fde;">PPU</span>[? if blpm_formed : + <span style="color: #00e8ff;">BLPM</span> ?] + <span style="color: #fbffd5;">[+ dvp_name +]</span> ([+ liberal_coalition_mer +]%)
choose-if: liberal_coalition_mer >= 50 and liberal_unity >= 40
unavailable-subtitle: [? if liberal_unity <= 40: Liberals are too conflicted to form a coherent goverment ?]
on-arrival: merkia_gov = 2; ddp_mer_gov = 1; z_mer_gov = 1; ppu_mer_gov = 1; dvp_mer_gov = 1;

@lib_whide
subtitle: <span style="color: #ddd500;">FVP</span> + GDSU + <span style="color: #4b9fde;">PPU</span>[? if blpm_formed : + <span style="color: #00e8ff;">BLPM</span> ?] + <span style="color: #fbffd5;">[+ dvp_name +]</span> + Other ([+ wide_liberal_coalition_mer +]%)
view-if: wide_liberal_coalition_mer >= 50 and wide_liberal_coalition_mer <= 50
choose-if: wide_liberal_coalition_mer >= 50 and liberal_unity >= 40
unavailable-subtitle: [? if liberal_unity <= 40: Liberals are too conflicted to form a coherent goverment ?]
on-arrival: merkia_gov = 2; ddp_mer_gov = 1; z_mer_gov = 1; ppu_mer_gov = 1; other_mer_gov = 1; dvp_mer_gov = 1;

@cent_right
subtitle: <span style="color: #48ba48;">GDSU</span> + <span style="color: #4b9fde;">PPU</span>[? if blpm_formed : + <span style="color: #00e8ff;">BLPM</span> ?] + <span style="color: #fbffd5;">[+ dvp_name +]</span> + Other[? if gnvp_formed : + <span style="color: #774ae2;">GNVP</span> ?] + <span style="color: #1027dc;">MNVP</span> ([+ center_right_coalition_mer +]%)
view-if: center_right_coalition_mer >= 45
choose-if: center_right_coalition_mer >= 50 and (dnvp_path - gdsu_ideology + 2 - ldp_ideology) >= 0 and liberal_unity >= 30
unavailable-subtitle: [? if liberal_unity <= 30: Liberals are too conflicted to form a coherent goverment. ?][? if (dnvp_path - gdsu_ideology + 2 - ldp_ideology) < 0: Liberals are unwilling to compromise with the MNVP. ?]
on-arrival: merkia_gov = 3; z_mer_gov = 1; ppu_mer_gov = 1; other_mer_gov = 1; dvp_mer_gov = 1; gnvp_mer_gov = 1; dnvp_mer_gov = 1;

@right
subtitle: <span style="color: #fbffd5;">[+ dvp_name +]</span> + Other[? if gnvp_formed : + <span style="color: #774ae2;">GNVP</span> ?] + <span style="color: #1027dc;">MNVP</span> ([+ right_coalition_mer +]%)
view-if: right_coalition_mer >= 45
choose-if: right_coalition_mer >= 50
on-arrival: merkia_gov = 3; other_mer_gov = 1; dvp_mer_gov = 1; gnvp_mer_gov = 1; dnvp_mer_gov = 1;

@far_right
subtitle: <span style="color: #fbffd5;">[+ dvp_name +]</span> + Other[? if gnvp_formed : + <span style="color: #774ae2;">GNVP</span> ?] + <span style="color: #1027dc;">MNVP</span> + <span style="color: #706a65;">NSDAP</span>([+ hitler_right_coalition_mer +]%)
view-if: hitler_right_coalition_mer >= 45 and nsdap_mer >= 10
choose-if: hitler_right_coalition_mer >= 50
on-arrival: merkia_gov = 3; other_mer_gov = 1; dvp_mer_gov = 1; gnvp_mer_gov = 1; dnvp_mer_gov = 1; nsdap_mer_gov = 1;

@coalition

Governing Arrangement:

Current Caversket Support: [+ custom_coalition_mer +]%

**Coalition:** [? if sapd_mer_coa = 1: KPM ?][? if asum_mer_coa = 1: ASUM ?][? if spm_mer_coa = 1: SPM ?][? if fvp_mer_coa = 1: FVP ?][? if gdsu_mer_coa = 1: GDSU ?][? if blpm_mer_coa = 1: BLPM ?][? if ppu_mer_coa = 1: PPU ?][? if ldp_mer_coa = 1: LDP ?]

*Toleration:* [? if sapd_mer_coa = 2: KPM ?][? if asum_mer_coa = 2: ASUM ?][? if spm_mer_coa = 2: SPM ?][? if fvp_mer_coa = 2: FVP ?][? if gdsu_mer_coa = 2: GDSU ?][? if blpm_mer_coa = 2: BLPM ?][? if ppu_mer_coa = 2: PPU ?][? if ldp_mer_coa = 2: LDP ?]

Opposition: [? if sapd_mer_coa = 0: KPM ?][? if asum_mer_coa = 0: ASUM ?][? if spm_mer_coa = 0: SPM ?][? if fvp_mer_coa = 0: FVP ?][? if gdsu_mer_coa = 0: GDSU ?][? if blpm_mer_coa = 0: BLPM ?][? if ppu_mer_coa = 0: PPU ?][? if ldp_mer_coa = 0: LDP ?]

-@kpm_gov: We should try a colaition with the KPM.
-@kpm_tol: Maybe we can try to get KPM toleration.
-@kpm_gov_drop: Leave the KPM out of the coalition.
-@kpm_tol_drop: Drop the KPM toleration.
-@asum_gov: We should try a colaition with the ASUM.
-@asum_tol: Maybe we can try to get ASUM toleration.
-@asum_gov_drop: Leave the ASUM out of the coalition.
-@asum_tol_drop: Drop the ASUM toleration.
-@spm_gov: We should try a colaition with the SPM.
-@spm_gov_drop: Leave the SPM out of the coalition.
-@fvp_gov: We should try a colaition with the FVP.
-@fvp_tol: Maybe we can try to get FVP toleration.
-@fvp_gov_drop: Leave the FVP out of the coalition.
-@fvp_tol_drop: Drop the FVP toleration.
-@gdsu_gov: We should try a colaition with the GDSU.
-@gdsu_tol: Maybe we can try to get GDSU toleration.
-@gdsu_gov_drop: Leave the GDSU out of the coalition.
-@gdsu_tol_drop: Drop the GDSU toleration.
-@blpm_gov: We should try a colaition with the BLPM.
-@blpm_tol: Maybe we can try to get BLPM toleration.
-@blpm_gov_drop: Leave the BLPM out of the coalition.
-@blpm_tol_drop: Drop the BLPM toleration.
-@ppu_gov: We should try a colaition with the PPU.
-@ppu_tol: Maybe we can try to get PPU toleration.
-@ppu_gov_drop: Leave the PPU out of the coalition.
-@ppu_tol_drop: Drop the PPU toleration.
-@ldp_gov: We should try a colaition with the [+ dvp_name +].
-@ldp_gov_drop: Leave the [+ dvp_name +] out of the coalition.

@kpm_gov
view-if: sapd_formed > 0
choose-if: kpm_coa >= 50
on-arrival: sapd_mer_coa = 1; custom_coalition_mer += sapd_mer;
go-to: coalition

@kpm_tol
view-if: sapd_formed > 0
choose-if: kpm_coa >= 50
on-arrival: sapd_mer_coa = 2; custom_coalition_mer += sapd_mer;
go-to: coalition

@kpm_gov_drop
view-if: sapd_formed > 0 and sapd_mer_coa = 1
on-arrival: sapd_mer_coa = 0;  custom_coalition_mer -= sapd_mer;
go-to: coalition

@kpm_tol_drop
view-if: sapd_formed > 0 and sapd_mer_coa = 2
on-arrival: sapd_mer_coa = 0; custom_coalition_mer -= sapd_mer;
go-to: coalition

@asum_gov
view-if: asum_formed > 0
choose-if: (kpm_coa + spm_coa) >= 100
on-arrival: asum_mer_coa = 1; custom_coalition_mer += asum_mer;
go-to: coalition

@asum_tol
view-if: asum_formed > 0
choose-if: (kpm_coa + spm_coa) >= 100
on-arrival: asum_mer_coa = 2; custom_coalition_mer += asum_mer;
go-to: coalition

@asum_gov_drop
view-if: asum_formed > 0 and asum_mer_coa = 1
on-arrival: asum_mer_coa = 0; custom_coalition_mer -= asum_mer;
go-to: coalition 

@asum_tol_drop
view-if: asum_formed > 0 and asum_mer_coa = 2
on-arrival: asum_mer_coa = 0; custom_coalition_mer -= asum_mer;
go-to: coalition

@spm_gov
view-if: spm_formed > 0
choose-if: spm_coa >= 50
on-arrival: spm_mer_coa = 1; custom_coalition_mer += spm_mer;
go-to: coalition

@spm_gov_drop
view-if: spm_formed > 0 and spm_mer_coa = 1
on-arrival: spm_mer_coa = 0; custom_coalition_mer -= spm_mer;
go-to: coalition

@fvp_gov
view-if: fvp_formed > 0
choose-if: fvp_coa >= 50
on-arrival: fvp_mer_coa = 1; custom_coalition_mer += ddp_mer;
go-to: coalition

@fvp_tol
view-if: fvp_formed > 0
choose-if: fvp_coa >= 50
on-arrival: fvp_mer_coa = 2; custom_coalition_mer += ddp_mer;
go-to: coalition

@fvp_gov_drop
view-if: asum_formed > 0 and asum_mer_coa = 1
on-arrival: asum_mer_coa = 0; custom_coalition_mer -= ddp_mer;
go-to: coalition

@fvp_tol_drop
view-if: asum_formed > 0 and asum_mer_coa = 2
on-arrival: asum_mer_coa = 0; custom_coalition_mer -= ddp_mer;
go-to: coalition

@gdsu_gov
choose-if: gdsu_coa >= 50
on-arrival: gdsu_mer_coa = 1; custom_coalition_mer += z_mer;
go-to: coalition

@gdsu_tol
choose-if: gdsu_coa >= 50
on-arrival: gdsu_mer_coa = 2; custom_coalition_mer += z_mer;
go-to: coalition

@gdsu_gov_drop
view-if: gdsu_mer_coa = 1
on-arrival: asum_mer_coa = 0; custom_coalition_mer -= z_mer;
go-to: coalition

@gdsu_tol_drop
view-if: gdsu_mer_coa = 2 
on-arrival: asum_mer_coa = 0; custom_coalition_mer -= z_mer;
go-to: coalition

@ppu_gov
choose-if: ppu_coa >= 50
on-arrival: ppu_mer_coa = 1; custom_coalition_mer += ppu_mer;
go-to: coalition

@ppu_tol
choose-if: ppu_coa >= 50
on-arrival: ppu_mer_coa = 2; custom_coalition_mer += ppu_mer;
go-to: coalition

@ppu_gov_drop
view-if: ppu_mer_coa = 1
on-arrival: asum_mer_coa = 0; custom_coalition_mer -= ppu_mer;
go-to: coalition

@ppu_tol_drop
view-if: ppu_mer_coa = 2
on-arrival: asum_mer_coa = 0; custom_coalition_mer -= ppu_mer;
go-to: coalition

@blpm_gov
view-if: blpm_formed > 0
choose-if: blpm_coa >= 50
on-arrival: blpm_mer_coa = 1; custom_coalition_mer += blpm_mer;
go-to: coalition

@blpm_tol
view-if: blpm_formed > 0
choose-if: blpm_coa >= 50
on-arrival: blpm_mer_coa = 2; custom_coalition_mer += blpm_mer;
go-to: coalition

@blpm_gov_drop
view-if: blpm_formed > 0 and blpm_mer_coa = 1 
on-arrival: blpm_mer_coa = 0; custom_coalition_mer -= blpm_mer;
go-to: coalition

@blpm_tol_drop
view-if: blpm_formed > 0 and blpm_mer_coa = 2
on-arrival: blpm_mer_coa = 0; custom_coalition_mer -= blpm_mer;
go-to: coalition

@ldp_gov
choose-if: ldp_coa >= 50
on-arrival: ldp_mer_coa = 1; custom_coalition_mer += dvp_mer;
go-to: coalition

@ldp_gov_drop
view-if: ldp_mer_coa = 1
on-arrival: ldp_mer_coa = 0; custom_coalition_mer -= dvp_mer;
go-to: coalition





